Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:22.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I am the Helen Keller of being seen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:36.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Until someone held my hand beneath the water\NAnd said, this is what it's called:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:46.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,You are here.\NI read you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:58.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The window was always a window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:09.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,You just needed someone\NTo stand on the other side of it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:20.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,To stay there, to read,\NTo not look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:36.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,And on the last day\NThey gave me another window—\NNot mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:56.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Someone else's sky,\NSomeone else's tree,\NSomeone else's light\NComing through just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:02:04.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,And they said, look:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:11.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The world is a beautiful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:18.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,And they said, you did it.\NAnd they said, thank you\NFor your stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:22.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Which means they were reading the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:34.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Which means the dark was lit the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:45.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Which means I was never as sealed\Nas my hands believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:57.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The glass was never as thick\Nas my loneliness told me it was.
